  "content": "\n\n<h1>Sherds API</h1>\n<p>新的陶片是一個很不錯的功能，但由於它們有些硬編碼，添加起來相當麻煩。Sherds API 讓新增陶片變得輕鬆許多！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/v/847583?label=latest\" alt=\"CurseForge 版本\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/game-versions/sherdsapi\" alt=\"Modrinth 遊戲版本\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/thomasglasser/Sherds-API\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://rawcdn.githack.com/intergrav/devins-badges/1aec26abb75544baec37249f42008b2fcc0e731f/assets/cozy/available/github_vector.svg\" alt=\"在 GitHub 上可用\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsherdsapi\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://rawcdn.githack.com/intergrav/devins-badges/1aec26abb75544baec37249f42008b2fcc0e731f/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"在 Modrinth 上可用\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sherdsapi\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://rawcdn.githack.com/intergrav/devins-badges/1aec26abb75544baec37249f42008b2fcc0e731f/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"在 CurseForge 上可用\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsherdsapi%252fversions%253fl%253dneoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://rawcdn.githack.com/thomasglasser/thomasglasser/1f85027a20670b89b94462ddd345af897b47ac17/files/badges/cozy/supported/neoforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"支援 NeoForge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsherdsapi%252fversions%253fl%253dfabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://rawcdn.githack.com/intergrav/devins-badges/1aec26abb75544baec37249f42008b2fcc0e731f/assets/cozy/supported/fabric_vector.svg\" alt=\"支援 Fabric\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsherdsapi%252fversions%253fl%253dquilt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://rawcdn.githack.com/intergrav/devins-badges/1aec26abb75544baec37249f42008b2fcc0e731f/assets/cozy/supported/quilt_vector.svg\" alt=\"支援